#
# iso-eda keymap preset: xschem-style (docs/PLAN.md: "Bindkey presets:
# Virtuoso-style and xschem-style"). Parsed by crates/eda-ui/src/keymap.rs.
#
# Format: one binding per line, "<modifiers>+<key> = <command.id>".
# Modifiers (any order, joined by '+', case-insensitive): ctrl, shift,
# alt, meta. <key> is matched case-insensitively against the pressed
# key's text. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# "ui.open_palette" is not an eda-cmd command: it is handled by eda-ui
# itself (opening the command palette is UI chrome, not an undoable
# change to CommandContext).
ctrl+shift+p = ui.open_palette
ctrl+z = edit.undo
ctrl+shift+z = edit.redo
ctrl+t = view.toggle_theme
ctrl+h = app.hello
